Z||000003||FieroJoe||02-10-2001||10:11 PM||||mmmmm Ice.....NO FUN!<P>After a friday's worth of 50* weather and all day of rain, it went below freezing friday night/saturday morning.  When I go to start my car before going to work, the door lock cylender was definatly frozen, and the car was a huge icicle.  So, I spray about a whole can of that lock de-icer in there, and it finally turns, unlocking all of my doors.  But, of course, the entire door is frozen shut.  I make my way in through the passenger door (it was on the lee side of the rain), and have to kick the drivers door open.  After that, I spend about 25 minutes getting all the ice off my windows.  Stupid a$$ winter weather.  I say, either it be cold all the time, or warm up and stay that way!<P>------------------<BR>FieroJoe<BR>c311t@yahoo.com<BR>AIM: Fiero87311, Snowboarder0311<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/profile_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
